    {"hk": "有落", "jp": "jau5 lok6", "en": "\"getting off!\" (said to a minibus driver)", "fr": "« je descends ! » (en minibus)", "note": "Shout it loudly before your stop. Add the place: 前面有落 = stop up ahead.",
